msgstr "The temperature reached {n} °C, close to the safe maximum, and MintMachine stopped the test. Check that the ventilation grilles are not blocked and leave free space around the computer. If it happens again with the computer well ventilated, have a repair service check the cooling."

msgid "La prueba ha encontrado errores. Guarda tu trabajo y, si el equipo se cuelga o se reinicia solo con frecuencia, consulta con un servicio técnico."
